WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.786
This supplied fictional rehearsal uses a one-page cue

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:06.780
sheet with STORY headings, time allowances, visual actions,

00:00:06.954 --> 00:00:10.635
and evidence references. The first attempt lasts eight

00:00:10.681 --> 00:00:14.327
minutes and twenty seconds. The operations section repeats

00:00:14.385 --> 00:00:16.916
too much prompt history, and the speaker cannot

00:00:16.986 --> 00:00:20.297
quickly find the exception record. The revision removes

00:00:20.332 --> 00:00:23.002
the prompt recital, places the correct evidence reference

00:00:23.037 --> 00:00:25.429
beside the exception cue, and keeps the human

00:00:25.452 --> 00:00:28.285
approval condition. The author rehearses that weakest section

00:00:28.331 --> 00:00:30.653
again, then checks the full order and timing.

00:00:31.315 --> 00:00:34.032
In this supplied example, the second complete rehearsal

00:00:34.101 --> 00:00:37.097
lasts six minutes and ten seconds. Those are

00:00:37.155 --> 00:00:41.229
fictional teaching observations, not your rehearsal results. Record

00:00:41.276 --> 00:00:44.132
your own actual times, difficult moment, correction, and

00:00:44.201 --> 00:00:47.801
new observation. Clear delivery must preserve supported results

00:00:47.835 --> 00:00:48.695
and honest limits.
